          <span class="who-city">Miami, FL</span>
          <span class="who-city">Fort Lauderdale, FL</span>
          <span class="who-city">Boca Raton, FL</span>
          <span class="who-city">Los Angeles, CA</span>
          <span class="who-city">Chicago, IL</span>
          <span class="who-city">Atlanta, GA</span>
          <span class="who-city">Dallas, TX</span>
          <span class="who-city">Houston, TX</span>
          <span class="who-city">Las Vegas, NV</span>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:300;color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);margin-top:14px">We buy jewelry in any city across the United States.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════════════ WHAT WE BUY ════════════ -->
<section class="section" id="what-we-buy" style="background:var(--black);padding-bottom:0">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="tag">What We Purchase</span>
      <h2>We Buy All Types<br/>of <em>Fine Jewelry</em></h2>
      <div class="section-divider"></div>
      <p class="section-sub">From one piece to entire collections — we pay the highest prices in the market. Safe, secure and confidential.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="buy-grid reveal">
    <div class="buy-card">
      <div class="img-ph buy-card-img"><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="48" height="48" rx="4" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="20" cy="22" r="6" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M4 40 L16 28 L26 38 L36 26 L52 44" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
      <div class="buy-card-overlay"></div>
      <div class="buy-card-content">
        <div class="buy-card-bar"></div>
        <div class="buy-card-label" style="margin-top:8px">Gold<br/>Jewelry</div>
        <div class="buy-card-sub">All karats accepted</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buy-card">
      <div class="img-ph buy-card-img"><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="48" height="48" rx="4" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="20" cy="22" r="6" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M4 40 L16 28 L26 38 L36 26 L52 44" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
      <div class="buy-card-overlay"></div>
      <div class="buy-card-content">
        <div class="buy-card-bar"></div>
        <div class="buy-card-label" style="margin-top:8px">Diamonds</div>
        <div class="buy-card-sub">GIA certified welcome</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buy-card">
      <div class="img-ph buy-card-img"><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="48" height="48" rx="4" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="20" cy="22" r="6" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M4 40 L16 28 L26 38 L36 26 L52 44" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
      <div class="buy-card-overlay"></div>
      <div class="buy-card-content">
        <div class="buy-card-bar"></div>
        <div class="buy-card-label" style="margin-top:8px">Platinum<br/>Jewelry</div>
        <div class="buy-card-sub">Any condition</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buy-card">
      <div class="img-ph buy-card-img"><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="48" height="48" rx="4" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="20" cy="22" r="6" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M4 40 L16 28 L26 38 L36 26 L52 44" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
      <div class="buy-card-overlay"></div>
      <div class="buy-card-content">
        <div class="buy-card-bar"></div>
        <div class="buy-card-label" style="margin-top:8px">Designer<br/>Jewelry</div>
        <div class="buy-card-sub">Cartier, Tiffany, Van Cleef</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buy-card">
      <div class="img-ph buy-card-img"><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="48" height="48" rx="4" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="20" cy="22" r="6" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M4 40 L16 28 L26 38 L36 26 L52 44" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
      <div class="buy-card-overlay"></div>
      <div class="buy-card-content">
        <div class="buy-card-bar"></div>
        <div class="buy-card-label" style="margin-top:8px">Antique &amp;<br/>Estate Jewelry</div>
        <div class="buy-card-sub">Art Deco, Victorian…</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="buy-card">
      <div class="img-ph buy-card-img"><svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="48" height="48" rx="4" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="20" cy="22" r="6" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M4 40 L16 28 L26 38 L36 26 L52 44" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
      <div class="buy-card-overlay"></div>
      <div class="buy-card-content">
        <div class="buy-card-bar"></div>
        <div class="buy-card-label" style="margin-top:8px">Luxury<br/>Pieces</div>
        <div class="buy-card-sub">Rolex, Patek Philippe…</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Also buy row -->
  <div class="container" style="padding-top:0">
    <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);border-top:none;padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px">
      <div>
        <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);margin-bottom:12px">We also buy</p>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px">
          <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500;padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);color:rgba(255,255,255,.45)">Rings</span>
          <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500;padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);color:rgba(255,255,255,.45)">Necklaces</span>
          <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500;padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);color:rgba(255,255,255,.45)">Bracelets</span>
          <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500;padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);color:rgba(255,255,255,.45)">Earrings</span>
          <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500;padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);color:rgba(255,255,255,.45)">Pendants</span>
          <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500;padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);color:rgba(255,255,255,.45)">Watches &amp; Jewelry Sets</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#get-offer">Get a Free Offer →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════════════ PROCESS ════════════ -->
<section class="section process-section" id="process">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process-header-wrap reveal">
      <h2>Our 5-Step Process<br/>to <em>Buy Your Jewelry</em></h2>
      <div>
        <p>Simple, transparent and secure.<br/>Get top dollar for your jewelry in 5 easy steps.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:20px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px">
          <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--gold)">100% CONFIDENTIAL</span>
          <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.2)">•</span>
          <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--gold)">NO OBLIGATION</span>
          <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.2)">•</span>
          <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--gold)">IMMEDIATE PAYMENT</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="process-steps reveal">
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <div class="step-icon">📸</div>
        <div class="step-title">Request an Offer</div>
        <div class="step-body">Send us photos of your jewelry via our form, email or text. Quick and easy.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <div class="step-icon">⚖️</div>
        <div class="step-title">Provide Details</div>
        <div class="step-body">Tell us the type of jewelry, approximate weight, metal, stones and any certificates.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <div class="step-icon">🔍</div>
        <div class="step-title">Expert Evaluation</div>
        <div class="step-body">Our experts evaluate your jewelry and determine the best market value.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">4</div>
        <div class="step-icon">📄</div>
        <div class="step-title">Receive Your Offer</div>
        <div class="step-body">You'll receive a fair, no-obligation offer. We pay the highest prices.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">5</div>
        <div class="step-icon">💵</div>
        <div class="step-title">Get Paid Immediately</div>
        <div class="step-body">Accept the offer and get paid instantly by cash, wire or check.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="process-footer reveal">
      <p>Ready to get started? It's free, fast &amp; confidential.</p>
      <a href="#get-offer">Book Your Free Evaluation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════════════ WHY US ════════════ -->
<section class="section why-section" id="about" style="padding:0">
  <div class="why-grid" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto">
    <div class="why-left reveal">
      <div class="img-ph why-left-img">
        <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="48" height="48" rx="4" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="20" cy="22" r="6" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M4 40 L16 28 L26 38 L36 26 L52 44" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Expert / Team Photo</span>
      </div>
      <div class="why-left-quote">
        <blockquote>"Selling jewelry should feel safe, fair, and dignified."</blockquote>
        <cite>— ROC Diamonds &amp; Fine Jewelry, LLC</cite>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="why-right reveal">
      <span class="tag">Why Choose ROC</span>
      <h2>Sell &amp; Get Paid With<br/><em>Confidence</em></h2>
      <div class="why-items">
        <div class="why-item">
          <div class="why-item-icon">$</div>
          <div class="why-item-text"><h4>Highest Prices Paid</h4><p>We beat pawnshops, consignment stores and most auction houses. No commissions, no hidden fees — you keep every dollar.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <div class="why-item-icon">◆</div>
          <div class="why-item-text"><h4>GIA-Certified Experts</h4><p>Our in-house gemologists hold GIA credentials and decades of experience evaluating fine jewelry at the highest standard.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <div class="why-item-icon">🔒</div>
          <div class="why-item-text"><h4>Complete Discretion</h4><p>Every transaction is 100% private. We handle estate sales, divorce settlements and inherited collections with full confidentiality.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <div class="why-item-icon">✈️</div>
          <div class="why-item-text"><h4>We Travel to You</h4><p>We travel, we meet, we buy. Wherever you are across the USA, we come to you for large collections and estate evaluations.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:32px">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#get-offer">Get My Free Offer →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════════════ WIZARD ════════════ -->
<section class="section wizard-section" id="get-offer" style="padding:0">
  <div class="wizard-grid" style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto">
    <div class="wizard-left reveal">
      <span class="tag">Free Evaluation</span>
      <h2>Get a <em>Free Offer</em><br/>for Your Jewelry</h2>
      <p>Answer a few quick questions and our team will prepare a tailored offer before your appointment. Completely free, zero obligation, 100% confidential.</p>
      <ul class="wizard-benefits">
        <li>Same-day offer — no waiting</li>
        <li>Immediate payment upon acceptance</li>
        <li>GIA-certified expert evaluation</li>
        <li>Confidential &amp; secure process</li>
